      "created_at": "2012-09-07T03:47:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Creating my villains for the contest made me feel like writing another short story set in the Multiverse. However I have a few ideas and will probably only have time to write up one. So tell me which idea I should write about! I will list my ideas, and you can post which one you want me to write about! Which ever one is asked for more will be the one I write about!</p><p>Possible Stories:</p><p>Mr. Fixer Origin</p><p>Expatriette Origin</p><p>Wraith Origin</p><p>Haka Vs Ambuscade</p><p>Fanatic Vs Apostate (pre-reedemer)</p><p>Create-A-Villain 1 Story (Title: The End of All)*</p><p>Create-A-Villain 2 Story (Title: A Fatal Trade)*</p><p><em>*Will not be released until after the contest is over</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I will check back Monday night after I get back from work, so you have until now till Monday around 10:30 PM EST!</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
