      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-07T10:40:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My only thought is that I wouldn't recommend doing anything origin or arc (such as the Fanatic vs. Apostate encounter that brings her low), as those stories could possibily be told in an official venue and it wouldn't be as much fun to have your version \"stepped on\" by official versions. If you can come up with stories that stand alone in the multiverse, you'll be better off.</p>\n<p>Just my thought, though.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>",
